flowchart TD
    Start([PR Created / Synchronized]) --> Pipeline[PR Quality Pipeline\n.github/workflows/pr-quality-pipeline.yml]

    subgraph Stage1 [Stage 1: Pre-Flight & Syntax Validation ~30s]
        Pipeline --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeeper\n- Branch name & template check]
        Gate -->|Pass| Lint[2. Linters & Formatters\n- Super-Linter / ESLint / Prettier]
        Gate -->|Fail| GateFail[Apply 'needs-metadata'\nHalt pipeline]
        Lint -->|Fail| LintFail[Apply 'lint-failed'\nHalt pipeline]
    end

    subgraph Stage2 [Stage 2: Build & Compilation ~30s]
        Lint -->|Pass| Build[3. Build Verification\n- TypeScript, Go, Rust, .NET]
        Build -->|Fail| BuildFail[Apply 'build-failed'\nHalt pipeline]
    end

    subgraph Stage3 [Stage 3: Deep Verification in Parallel ~1-2m]
        Build -->|Pass| DeepChecks{Parallel Stage 3}
        DeepChecks --> Test[4. Automated Tests & Coverage\n- Diff-scoped >= 80% coverage]
        DeepChecks --> Sec[5. Security & Quality\n- CodeQL SAST, Dep Review, Secrets]
        DeepChecks --> DocEval[6. PR Documentation Evaluator\n- gh-aw semantic evaluation]
    end

    %% Remediation loops
    GateFail --> AgentMeta[🤖 PR Validation Agent]
    LintFail --> AgentLint[🤖 PR Lint Fixer]
    Test -->|< 80% Coverage| CovFail[Apply 'test-required'] --> AgentTest[🤖 PR Test Generator\nStacked PR]
    Sec -->|Alerts| SecFail[Apply 'codeql-alert' / 'dependency-alert'] --> AgentSec[🤖 PR Security Fixers\nStacked PR]
    DocEval -->|Docs Missing| DocFail[Apply 'docs-required'] --> AgentDoc[🤖 PR Documentation Updater\nStacked PR]

    AgentTest & AgentSec & AgentDoc --> AutoMerge[Auto-Merge Stacked PR into Branch\n.github/workflows/pr-stacked-merge.yml]
    AutoMerge --> Start

    %% Review Stage
    Test & Sec & DocEval -->|All Green & Settled| Dispatcher[7. PR Review Dispatcher\nPost summary & assign Copilot]
    Dispatcher --> AICodeReview[GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI architectural & diff review]
    AICodeReview --> HumanReview[Developer Final Sign-Off & Review]
    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge PR into Main])
